          "statement": "The decomposition includes a component author-agent (proposal writer), whose repo home is .claude/agents/author and which serves C-S8.",
          "attributes": {"description": "proposal writer", "repoHome": ".claude/agents/author", "serves": ["C-S8"]},
          "groundedBy": [
            {"fragment": "sf:2dae2c3e4037400722c3049c", "label": "S5.author-agent", "role": "primary"},
            {"fragment": "sf:6a78e67028f988a49aa9f336", "label": "S5.table-header", "role": "definition", "why": "names the columns: Component, Repo home, Serves"}
          ]
        },
        {
          "@id": "a:decomposition:traceability",
          "@type": "PrescribedInvariant",
          "role": "Normative", "force": "obligation", "scope": "in-scope",
          "statement": "Every component is traceable to the capabilities it serves; no component serves nothing.",
          "groundedBy": [{"fragment": "sf:0b3c700c6c80dcd0b3992c92", "label": "S5.traceable", "role": "primary"}]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sr:L2:S-S4",
      "@type": "SpecificationRecord",
      "title": "Seam S-S4 — panel / attack → findings store",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "@id": "a:S-S4:seam",
          "@type": "InterfaceSpecification",
          "role": "Normative", "force": "obligation", "scope": "in-scope",
          "target": {"@type": "SpecificationTargetDescription", "kind": "seam", "name": "S-S4"},
          "statement": "Seam S-S4 has producer panel / attack and consumer findings store; its contract is the Finding record; its crossing example is the literal {\"id\": \"F-017\", \"source\": \"stub-builder\", \"severity\": \"critical\", \"clause\": \"spec.md:§3/C2\", \"text\": \"signature satisfiable by empty redirect\", \"replay\": \"attacks/stub-017/\"}; status filled.",
          "attributes": {
            "producer": "panel / attack",
            "consumer": "findings store",
            "contract": "Finding record",
            "crossingExample": {"id": "F-017", "source": "stub-builder", "severity": "critical", "clause": "spec.md:§3/C2", "text": "signature satisfiable by empty redirect", "replay": "attacks/stub-017/"},
            "status": "filled"
          },
          "absence": "The source names the findings store as this seam's consumer and states no interface by which any other capability reads from it — see diag:store-read-interface-unstated and diag:store-component-unstated.",
          "groundedBy": [{"fragment": "sf:f743e46fcb17bf1038e2560e", "label": "S6.S-S4", "role": "primary"}]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "diagnostics": [
    {
      "@id": "diag:store-read-interface-unstated",
      "@type": "UnderdeterminationDiagnostic",
      "blocking": true,
      "cone": ["projection of the author-agent → findings-store seam (names, signatures)"],
      "statement": "C-S8 takes 'findings for cycle N' as input and S-S4 names a findings store as its consumer, but the source states no interface by which C-S8 reads findings: no function names, no signatures, no seam from the store to C-S8 in §6.",
      "evidence": ["sf:50ca7c6fbd05d737117613fe", "sf:f743e46fcb17bf1038e2560e"],
      "legalOutputs": "representable absence (recorded in a:S-S4:seam.absence), this diagnostic, and a labeled closure proposal — sr:L3:findings-read-seam",
      "status": "open"
    },
    {
      "@id": "diag:store-component-unstated",
      "@type": "UnderdeterminationDiagnostic",
      "blocking": true,
      "cone": ["module boundaries for the findings store and for shared types"],
      "statement": "§5 lists nine components; none owns the findings store, and none is a shared-types module. The baseline plan's `panel-findings-store` and `contract` are therefore not prescribed by the source.",
      "evidence": ["sf:6a78e67028f988a49aa9f336", "sf:2dae2c3e4037400722c3049c", "sf:0b3c700c6c80dcd0b3992c92"],
      "legalOutputs": "this diagnostic and labeled closure proposals — sr:L3:panel-findings-store-interface, sr:L3:module-boundaries",
      "status": "open"
    },
    {
      "@id": "diag:Finding-fields-by-example",
      "@type": "MissingInformation",
      "blocking": false,
      "statement": "The source enumerates Finding's fields only through two literal examples; `replay` appears in one. Whether replay is optional, and whether the field set is closed, is not stated.",
      "evidence": ["sf:bbdecf529e21b598e5c59b46", "sf:f743e46fcb17bf1038e2560e", "sf:3482babe3032ab57d14942de"],
      "status": "open"
    },
    {
      "@id": "diag:author-agent-repo-home-vs-plan",
      "@type": "ConflictingStatement",
      "spansLayers": true,
      "blocking": true,
      "cone": ["projection of author-agent's `files`"],
      "statement": "SRS §5 homes author-agent at .claude/agents/author (an agent charter). The baseline plan — a model-proposed artifact, not a registered source — places it at src/author-agent.ts. The source is univocal; the conflict is between the source and a proposed realization, so it is not a source-internal ConflictingStatement and cannot be resolved by interpretation. Routed to the architect as adjudication adj:author-agent-repo-home.",
      "evidence": ["sf:2dae2c3e4037400722c3049c"],
      "citedNotGrounding": ["spike/inputs/srs-seam-slice-plan.json#units[2].files"],
      "status": "open"
    }
  ],
